LoL Spy for League of Legends application is dedicated to all fans of League of Legends, no matter if they are beginners or pro's.

The app is featuring:
◉ Champion Builds:
- Builds for every single champion from "MobaFire"!
- We're also working on other champion builds to be available such as solomid, probuilds, lolpro & lolking. Stay tuned!

◉ Real Time Tracker - one of the most detailed ones available on the net. Forget about alt+tabbing to your browser to check your current game info:
- Runes & masteries that are currently in use;
- KDA ratio;
- Unranked wins;
- W/L ratio in rankeds;
- Current season League;
- Previous season highest tier;
- Summoner spells that are currently in use.

◉ Champions:
- Check spotlights of every champion (even not existing ones trololol);
- Check all information about champion abilities (videos are also included);
- Find champions that are strong or weak against specific champion. (champion counters);
- Champion skins! An ability to see their prices. A great opportunity to download any skin to your gallery. Also, you can choose any skin and directly set it as your device wallpaper;
- Lore;
- Stats + ally/enemy tips;

◉ Live & PBE news:
- RSS news feed about LoL udpates;
- RSS news feed about PBE updates.

◉ Items - full list of items from all existing game modes with incredibly informative descriptions, prices and etc..

And many more features to come with later updates!

P.S. Updates of League of Legends content reaches LoL Spy faster by 4-5 days before its official release! ;)

Supported languages:
- English;
- Polish;
- Spanish;
- Portuguese;
- German;
- Romanian;
- Russian;
- Turkish;
- Italian;
- French
- Greek;
- Many more are coming up in the near future!

